1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:01,991
(Amy:)So, listen, Sheldon, I was thinking...

2
00:00:02,470 --> 00:00:06,340
...since this is our first Halloween
party as boyfriend and girlfriend...

3
00:00:06,641 --> 00:00:09,771
(Amy:)...I thought it might be fun for us
to go in a couples' costume.

4
00:00:10,378 --> 00:00:12,208
(Sheldon:)I couldn't agree more.

5
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:16,840
(Amy:)Really? I find that inconsistent
with everything I know about you.

6
00:00:17,885 --> 00:00:23,185
Couples' costumes are one of
the few benefits of being in a relationship.

7
00:00:23,457 --> 00:00:25,717
Now, imagine this:

8
00:00:26,127 --> 00:00:28,687
(Sheldon:)You and I, entering Stuart's party...

9
00:00:28,996 --> 00:00:33,326
(Sheldon:)...and all eyes turn to see America's
most beloved and glamorous couple:

10
00:00:33,668 --> 00:00:36,898
- Yeah?
- R2-D2 and C-3P0.

11
00:00:39,807 --> 00:00:41,327
Dibs on '3P0.

12
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:47,500
Sheldon, when I said couples' costume,
I meant, like, Romeo and Juliet...

13
00:00:47,748 --> 00:00:49,548
(Amy:)...or Cinderella and Prince Charming.

14
00:00:49,750 --> 00:00:52,480
(Amy:)Not two robots
from some silly movie I don't even like.

15
00:00:52,687 --> 00:00:55,387
(Leonard:)Okay.

16
00:00:56,891 --> 00:01:03,021
(Sheldon:)I'm gonna let that slide because
I know you're hopped up on tea bags.

